<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG WINS WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG WINS WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>MAMMOTH LAKES, California 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pernilla Wiberg of Sweden won the women's World Cup slalom race at Mammoth Mountain on Friday.  </p>
<p>Sabine Egger of Austria came in second and Lara Magoni of Italy finished third, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>The results were later declared official.</p>
</text>
